flowchart TB
    CLI[Typer CLI] --> Engine
    Web[Local dashboard] --> REST
    REST[FastAPI on loopback] --> Engine
    MCP[FastMCP over stdio] --> Engine
    Engine[Local3D engine and worker] <--> Jobs[(SQLite jobs)]
    Engine --> Input{Input}
    subgraph Lock[Cross-process engine lock]
        Input -->|Prompt| Image[FLUX reference with MFLUX]
        Image --> Release[Image process exits]
        Input -->|Reference image| Geometry
        Release --> Geometry[Isolated MLX geometry and textures]
        Geometry -->|Worker exits| Blender[Headless Blender]
        Input -->|Procedural demo| Blender
        Blender --> Files[GLB or BLEND]
    end
    Files --> Result[Compact JSON with local paths and metrics]
    Result --> Jobs
